{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55906","headline":"偈颂（幷序○序爲南岳齐己撰） 六十三 · 居遁","name":"偈颂（幷序○序爲南岳齐己撰） 六十三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"拟住城隍守不非，见云生处又思归。\n三间茅舍喜犹在，九带青萝尚遶围。\n松柏近栽方始盛，槿花秋首未尝萎。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"居遁","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55906.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55906","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}